{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-88a59bac4d86f1bc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# TrustyAI\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: TrustyAI\n4\t**Maturity**: Stable (GA); lm-eval integration Tech Preview\n5\t**Owning team**: TrustyAI\n6\t**Upstream**: trustyai-explainability/trustyai-service-operator\n7\t**Midstream**: red-hat-data-services/trustyai-service-operator\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tModel quality and trustworthiness services: fairness/bias metrics, drift\n13\tdetection, explainability, and guardrails. Ships an operator that manages\n14\tTrustyAIService instances per data science project. The lm-eval job runner\n15\t(LMEvalJob CRD, wrapping EleutherAI lm-evaluation-harness) is Tech Preview and\n16\tis the platform's existing entry point for LLM benchmark execution.\n17\t\n18\t## Dependencies\n19\t\n20\t- KServe/ModelMesh inference endpoints as metric data sources\n21\t- Kubernetes Jobs for lm-eval benchmark execution\n22\t\n23\t## Interfaces\n24\t\n25\t- TrustyAIService and LMEvalJob CRDs (trustyai.opendatahub.io)\n26\t- REST metrics API consumed by the Dashboard\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b6ed9b072b05e483","agent_id":"aa6f18c4d5eb792e8","session_id":"d3abee14-bd6c-472b-9371-2ffa8d293b5d","uuid":"2ec17cbc-ba30-4c12-a44d-ea8535c3ad48","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:12:35.180Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-88a59bac4d86f1bc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9014 retry"}
